      "label": "证据与结果层",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "9a57e2b84f0c1d63",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**静态插件注册表**\n\nfeature id → ReviewDefinition\n\n未来页面只增加插件",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "0d8f3a721e4c596b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**直播单一场景目录**\n\n8 幕、弹幕、节奏、预期状态\n\n保留冻结趣味文案",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a62e9b4c731d085f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 830,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**共享评审核心**\n\n判别时间线、目录校验\n\nDisposableStack",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "31f8c65a0d29e4b7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 470,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "**通用 Orchestrator**\n\n逐幕隔离、自动为主\n\n交互模式可选",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "b407e1d95a6382cf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 470,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "**Playwright + ServerLease**\n\n新 context、web-first 断言\n\n只清理自有 Vite",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5c9a173b4206d8f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 830,
      "y": 470,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "**OBS WebSocket Adapter**\n\n来源同步、截图、区域比对\n\n恢复原场景",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "74d20b9e3a5f816c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 870,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "**Evidence v2 Store**\n\n原子、只追加、工件哈希\n\nv1 只读兼容",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "6b13f8c4e9a2057d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 870,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "**稳定轮次验证器**\n\n仅自动 + OBS 完整档\n\n顺序、指纹、工件均有效",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2ec759a1d80b4f36",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 830,
      "y": 870,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "**结果**\n\n完整报告或聚合失败\n\n连续两轮后定版",
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
